# The late-arrival audit companion is RFC 4180 CSV: CRLF-terminated by
# specification, and it is shared with Telematics support alongside
# docs/19_telematics_trips_late_arrival_audit.md. It is evidence and must round-trip
# byte-identically, so `-text` stops Git normalising the line endings and
# `whitespace=-trailing-space` stops `git diff --check` reading each CR as trailing
# whitespace. The file stays diffable; only the whitespace warning is suppressed.
artifacts/telematics_late_arrival_audit.csv -text whitespace=-trailing-space
